            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.3.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 3:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " (Munyo ji je kodi jocoki misolo jowinjo go, joyere gi wac pa Were rupiri Yohana obatisa jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Jofarisayo kodi Jondiko jocayo atoŋa pa Were rijo wegi, omiyo jokwero Yohana obatisa jo.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Anopima ji ma pama kodi aŋo, kosa jocale aŋo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocale nyithindho ma jobedo i katale. Aka kweth acel koko ri man ni, ‘Kole wakudho riwin madundo, to wikimielo; wawero wer ywak to wikiywaki!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yohana Jakibatisa obino ma riyo kec aka kimedhi, to wiwaco ni, ‘Go nigi jwogi kwoŋe!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Wod Dhano obino ma cemo aka oro gir'amadha to wiwaco ni, ‘Neni ŋato jaworo, odoko jamadhi vini, aka mere pa jocoki misolo kodi joreco!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To kad'ameno ji je ma joyeyo rieko pa Were jotero paka otire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu i ot pa Simon Jafarisayo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jafarisayo acel olwoŋo Yesu cemo peco pere. Munyo Yesu otundo peco pa Jafarisayo no to bedo dhower, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.26.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 26:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.14.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mar 14:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 12:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "dhako moro odonjo, m'onwaŋo odakana swa i tindi. Munyo go owinjo ni Yesu cemo i ot pa Jafarisayo no, obino gi cupa mo maŋwe kur, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to cungo yuŋeye dho ka tiende munyo ywak, to cako oyo pigi waŋe i tiendi Yesu, to yweyo gi ye wiye; to cwiyo tiende, to wiro gi mo maŋwe kur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo Jafarisayo m'olwoŋo Yesu oneno ameno, won owaco kende ni, “Bedi ŋati me bedi jatuci wac Were adieri, kole d'oŋeyo kiti dhako ma geyo go me, paka go jareco” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu ogamo dhoke ka waco ni, “Simon, nitie gim'amito waco rin.” Anago ni, “Jafonji, waci ran.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jal moro oyido nigi jobanjin pere ario; ŋat'acel obedo gi banja pere ma siringi miya abic, ŋatiman piero abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo culo pesa no odhiero jo, jalo ocwako joje. K'ameno, ŋa kwoŋ jono ma bino maro go loyo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Simon odwoko ni, “Aparo ni ŋata go ocwako banja madwoŋ loyo.” Yesu odwoko ni, “Itundo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owire oŋiyo dhako no, to waco ni, “Simon, ineno dhako me? Adonjo i ot perin, to ikimiyan kada pi ma lwoko tiendan, to go owok lwoko tiendan gi pigi waŋe, aka oyweyo kiri gi ye wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikicwiyo lemban, to go k'oweyo cwiyo tiendan cuka nende adonji ka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikiwiro mo i wiyan, to neni go owok wiro tiendan gi mo maŋwe kur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo awaco rin, mar m'oasere ma go onyutho omiyo reco pere madit otiek cwako rigo. Ato ŋat'ocwaki rigo manok ama nyutho mar manok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo Yesu owaco ri dhako no ni, “Reco perin otiek cwako rin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gikenyo joman m'onwaŋo jobedo i dhower jocako waco kendi gin ni, “Me ŋa ma bende cwako reco?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 7:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Yesu owaco ri dhako no ni, “Yeyo perin otieko bothin; kadhi i siem.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.7.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.7.50"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
